## Common Skill Templates

### Template 1: Testing Skill

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# runs tests and reports coverage

npm test -- --coverage
COVERAGE=$(grep -o '"lineCoverage"[^,]*' coverage/coverage-summary.json | cut -d: -f2)

if (( $(echo "$COVERAGE >= 80" | bc -l) )); then
  echo "✓ Coverage: $COVERAGE% - PASS"
else
  echo "✗ Coverage: $COVERAGE% - FAIL"
  exit 1
fi
```

### Template 2: Build and Deploy Skill

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# builds and deploys the application

set -e  # Exit on error

echo "Building project..."
npm run build

echo "Running tests..."
npm test

echo "Deploying..."
npm run deploy

echo "Deployment complete!"
```

### Template 3: Code Quality Skill

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# runs linting and formatting checks

echo "Running ESLint..."
npm run lint

echo "Checking formatting..."
npx prettier --check "src/**/*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx}"

echo "Type checking..."
npm run type-check

echo "All checks passed!"
```

