## Skill Limitations

| Limitation | Workaround |
|-----------|-----------|
| Can't prompt for user input | Use environment variables or command-line flags |
| Can't run interactive commands | Use non-interactive alternatives |
| Can't access secrets directly | Use `.env` files or credential managers |
| Can't modify Claude's core behavior | Work within skill's provided hooks |

